OL,3,AReform UK pledges to scrap hospital    
OL,4,Aparking fees in England                
OL,6,FReform UK is promising to scrap parking
OL,7,Ffees at NHS hospitals in England for   
OL,8,Fall patients, visitors, and staff if it
OL,9,Fwins power at the next election.       
OL,11,FThe party said rising parking charges  
OL,12,Fin recent years were unfair, with some 
OL,13,Fhospitals charging up to #20 a day for 
OL,14,Fparking spots.                         
OL,16,FIt says it would compensate hospital   
OL,17,Ftrusts for the #300m they currently get
OL,18,Ffrom fees each year by raising more    
OL,19,Ffrom foreign visitors using the NHS.   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
